  "question": "Where is the nearest restaurant you encounter heading toward Sycamore Park, Medina, OH from UH Rainbow Babies & Children\u2019s Hospital, Cleveland, OH?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.605748 41.504861)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.859349 41.123385)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.605748 41.504861)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.605748 41.504861)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
